# Jellyfin (README.md): music and video from a Jellyfin server, in Jellyfin's
# own look, with cover art. Music plays through the shell's player; video
# through libmpv, which comes with mpv. Lists and covers are fetched with
# curl, which is part of ZeroOS. It used to be a tab in the Media app.
NAME="Jellyfin"
SUMMARY="Music, movies and shows from your Jellyfin server, with cover art and search, in Jellyfin's own look"
APP_VERSION="2.4.0"
DEPENDS="mpv, libmpv2"
NEEDS="mpv"
